  "alternatives": [],
  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Hetlioz (tasimelteon) Criteria Version 2; Original 12/17/2018; Approval 3/18/2022; Effective 2022-05-01.",
    "Encoded: two closed indications, indication-specific age/formulation and clinical requirements, board-certified sleep specialty and shared denials. Failure to meet approval criteria is represented by approval clauses. Documentation attestations require manual review.",
    "Cautions (notes only): take without food; smoking can reduce effectiveness.",
    "Duration (notes only): initial approval up to 3 months; reauthorization up to 6 months with clinically meaningful chart notes showing positive response to combination Hetlioz and light therapy, based on minimum 14 day actigraphy after a minimum of 60 days of therapy and the last 30 days of sleep logs prior to reauthorization. Manual review required.",
    "Quantity limits (notes only): 30 \u00d7 20mg capsules per 30 days (1 capsule per day); one 158ml bottle per 30 days; two 48ml bottles per 30 days. Quantity enforcement requires manual review."
  ],
